{#- Combined deployment DDL for a "combined" conventions profile (acfc_prx) —
    the CREATE TABLE REFERENCE text (the client's "DDL" is the metadata
    INSERT rows, metadata_inserts.sql; MULTI_TABLE_DESIGN rule 8).
    One block per table and layer (multi-table step 6): each block is its
    banner ('--stage table' / '--standard table'), a blank line, the CREATE
    line naming the table by its MAPPED three-part name, '(', one bare
    'name type' line per column (',' after all but the last), ')', the
    per-layer prefix line and the USING clause; blocks are separated by one
    blank line. No LOCATION. post104: under the profile's knobs a column line
    may end in COMMENT '<text>', and the USING clause may be followed by a
    table COMMENT line and a TBLPROPERTIES block. post105 (run-safe): a
    CLUSTER BY line between them, the statement terminator after the CREATE,
    and an ALTER TABLE ... SET TAGS statement after a blank line; with every
    knob off the output is the golden's bare shape.
    Whitespace is data here: every blank line, the optional leading newline,
    the per-block prefix before the USING clause and the absence of a
    trailing newline reproduce the client golden byte for byte
    (docs/acfc/rfc_capture goldens/pair_1/ACCUM_DDL.txt), so every newline
    below is written explicitly and the template's own are trimmed. -#}
{{- "\n" if ddl.leading_newline else "" -}}
{%- for block in blocks -%}
{{- "\n\n" if not loop.first else "" -}}
{{- block.banner ~ "\n\n" ~ ddl.create_statement ~ " " ~ block.qualified ~ "\n(\n" -}}
{%- for name, dtype, comment in block.columns -%}
{{- name ~ " " ~ dtype ~ (" COMMENT '" ~ comment ~ "'" if comment else "")
    ~ ("," if not loop.last else "") ~ "\n" -}}
{%- endfor -%}
{{- ")\n" ~ block.using_prefix ~ "\n" ~ ddl.using_clause -}}
{{- "\nCOMMENT '" ~ block.table_comment ~ "'" if block.table_comment else "" -}}
{{- "\n" ~ block.cluster_by if block.cluster_by else "" -}}
{%- if block.tblproperties -%}
{{- "\nTBLPROPERTIES (" -}}
{%- for key, value in block.tblproperties -%}
{{- "\n  '" ~ key ~ "' = '" ~ value ~ "'" ~ ("," if not loop.last else ")") -}}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{{- ddl.statement_terminator -}}
{%- if block.tags -%}
{{- "\n\nALTER TABLE " ~ block.qualified ~ " SET TAGS ('DOMAIN' = '" ~ block.tags[0]
    ~ "', 'SUBDOMAIN' = '" ~ block.tags[1] ~ "')" ~ ddl.statement_terminator -}}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{{- "\n" if ddl.trailing_newline else "" -}}
